                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1166F00                                              *        
*                                                                               
*  FUNKTION   :  FIND UPDATED PART INFO TO SEND TO VSIM                         
*                BY MATCHING THE CURRENT TOTAL FILE WITH                        
*                THE PREVIOUS TOTAL FILE. ALL NEW AND CHANGED                   
*                RECORDS SHOULD BE SENT TO VSIM                                 
*                                                                               
*  FÖRFATTARE :  CHESTER COUCH                                         *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166FD1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W1166E  'INCURR-'                                                              
                                                                                
FILE W1166FD2                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W1166E  'INPREV-'                                                              
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166FD3 FB(168 0)                                                         
*                                                                               
%W1166E  'OUT-'                                                                 
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* STEG 1. MATCH TO FIND NEW RECORDS ON CURRENT FILE TO SEND TO VSIM             
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W1166FD1 KEY(INCURR-W1166E-CTX)  +                                   
           W1166FD2 KEY(INPREV-W1166E-CTX)  +                                   
          )                                                                     
                                                                                
   IF MATCHED                                                                   
   ELSE                                                                         
      IF W1166FD1                                                               
         OUT-W1166E-CTX      = INCURR-W1166E-CTX                                
         PUT W1166FD3                                                           
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
